MA HIROHISA</name><address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook> </applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>STELLA CHEMIFA KABUSHIKI KAISH</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WAKI MASAHIDE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAZAKI HIROSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKUDOME, TOSHIROU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIKUYAMA, HIROHISA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>STELLA CHEMIFA KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WAKI, MASAHIDE</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAZAKI, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUKUDOME TOSHIROU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KIKUYAMA HIROHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WAKI MASAHIDE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAZAKI HIROSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKUDOME, TOSHIROU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIKUYAMA, HIROHISA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WAKI, MASAHIDE</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAZAKI, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method of purifying lithium hexafluorophosphate, useful as an electrolyte for a secondary lithium battery or a catalyst for organic synthesis, to an extremely high purity. Phosphorus pentachloride is added to the lithium hexafluorophosphate to be purified which contains harmful impurities such as oxyfluorides and lithium fluoride.  Hydrofluoric acid is further added to the lithium hexafluorophosphate in at least an equivalent amount based on the phosphorus pentachloride, and is reacted with the pentachloride to yield phosphorus pentafluoride, with which the lithium fluoride is converted to lithium hexafluorophosphate to conduct purification.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Procédé permettant de purifier l'hexafluorophosphate de lithium, utile comme électrolyte dans une pile au lithium ou comme catalyseur de synthèse organique, jusqu'à une pureté très élevée. On ajoute du pentachlorure de phosphore à l'hexafluorophosphate de lithium à purifier, qui contient des impuretés gênantes telles que des oxyfluorures et du fluorure de lithium. Puis on ajoute de l'acide fluorhydrique à l'hexafluorophosphate de lithium, en une quantité au moins équivalente à celle du pentachlorure de phosphore, et on le met à réagir avec le pentachlorure de façon à produire du pentafluorure de phosphore, avec lequel le fluorure de lithium est converti en hexafluorophosphate de lithium, ce qui met en oeuvre la purification.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership 